                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Bowen to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-08-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 5, 1904</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received
                        August 6, 1904.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Later news of superintendent announces his release.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowen.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
